# The nine files of the Zenodo deposit, byte for byte.
# Version DOI <to be minted on publication> (0.9.1, 2026-10-05) - concept DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21763931
# Generated from the bytes of this release AND checked against the published record named above:
# tools/verify_deposit.py --from-zenodo re-fetches that record and hashes what comes back.
# tools/verify_deposit.py reads the record id from the line above, and refuses --from-zenodo while
# that line says <to be minted on publication>.
# Paths below are repository paths. The deposit stores flat names: the fixture is deposited as
# fixture_label_only.py, as it was in 0.4.0 through 0.6.0 (0.3.0 deposited four files and no
# fixture), and tools/verify_deposit.py matches the record's keys against an index built from
# basenames.
# Enforced on every push by .github/workflows/ci.yml.
# Verify:  python3 tools/verify_deposit.py     (or: shasum -a 256 -c DEPOSIT.sha256)
#
